#!/bin/bash
# 1.6.6 flag parity (2026-11-08, Coordinator rulings): TEST runs live's -D flags plus the declared 1.6.6 changes and the
# QA plumbing in docs/release/flag-parity.allow; tools/ops/flag-parity checks it. Off now: bossfight.reach (off on live),
# market.events/market.rumours (489362c7d) and botlife.preview (c0ce7dbe6), none of them on live. decide.shadow as live.
# Added as live: exchange.startHalted, exchange.traders.pct=35, exchange.traders.nx.worldHour=5000, solomapling.events,
# solomapling.tutorial-admin=false. The copy on mapletest (/opt/mapleroot-dev/persistence-test/start-test.sh) is installed
# from this file by tools/ops/deploy-test --start-script; previous: start-test.sh.pre-166-parity.
# 1.6.2 integration (2026-10-30): + every 1.6.2 feature switch for TEST (inspect 8198, nav trace, quests, temple, KPQ, gear, builds/support, job errands, maker batch, 2 runtime nav fixes; zmassWalls/teleportPhantomGuard held for a pre-bake). Previous: start-test.sh.pre-162.
# Starts slums-persistence-test the way it was launched before (transient unit).
